## Review boundaries and risks

Paper deferral may add fiber/water/cloth at the letters arrival rather than one existing Paper; measure relevance and both arrival/peak, not just completion. Hinge should remain at the workshop until stars, not ride through intervening scenes; this is an assertion to test. The unchanged recipe still technically permits remote Hinge crafting, but prior forge-context acceptance is **not** a physical validation of making a hinge at the headland. Fixing that unrestricted recipe would expand scope.

Workshop cannot ordinarily pre-make its chest before the first quarry visit, because ore is first exposed there. The already-complete test earns actual recipes, then renews entry metadata as an explicit synthetic fixture; it is not presented as an actual early-travel human route.

New scheduling/finale concepts need independent reviewer acceptance before publication. No GitHub, Sites, Clio or unto.me writes are authorized in this task. Rebase only onto the integrator's eventual frozen source, not its mutable candidate; heavy checks wait for its explicit slot release.
